WEBVTT

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:22.231
Toriko. Can you see anything?

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:24.608
Something's moving.

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.817
Is it coming this way?

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:28.070
I can't tell. It's hard to see.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:32.783
I don't like this. I think we
should wait it out here and...

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:34.618
Ah!

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:47.381
"Big Heads"

00:01:42.561 --> 00:01:43.729
"Kisaragi"
"Katasu - Yami"

00:02:22.518 --> 00:02:27.731
I decided to go explore
the Otherside with Toriko again.

00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:32.528
"A face-slimming hairstyle?!"

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:45.457
But is it a good idea to keep
hanging around with her?

00:02:45.457 --> 00:02:48.126
I mean, we were in serious danger last time.

00:02:48.126 --> 00:02:52.965
Despite that, Toriko decided the date of
our next adventure as if it were a given.

00:02:52.965 --> 00:02:59.221
And I'm just going along with it.
This <i>really </i>isn't working.

00:02:59.221 --> 00:03:02.266
I should probably rethink this.

00:03:02.266 --> 00:03:05.435
Sorawo. Been waiting long?

00:03:08.647 --> 00:03:12.442
She really is pretty. Damnit.

00:03:12.442 --> 00:03:13.652
Is something the matter?

00:03:13.652 --> 00:03:14.862
No.

00:03:14.862 --> 00:03:16.613
You were gonna say something.

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:21.285
Never mind that. If we're gonna go,
let's go. We don't have all day.

00:03:29.585 --> 00:03:31.461
Wait up!

00:03:31.461 --> 00:03:33.922
Wait up!

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:48.896
Sorawo, you're always in such a hurry.

00:03:50.689 --> 00:03:52.482
Hmm?

00:04:45.369 --> 00:04:48.705
Are you crazy? Why would
you mess with Elevator Girl?

00:04:48.705 --> 00:04:53.210
Umm, I thought she wasn't around today,
so I let my guard down.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.671
But then she popped up
in a totally different place.

00:04:55.671 --> 00:04:57.256
That was a real shocker, huh?

00:04:57.256 --> 00:04:58.590
Did we shoot her?

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.718
No... At least, I don't think so.

00:05:02.928 --> 00:05:06.974
That's a relief. You're not a murderer.

00:05:06.974 --> 00:05:10.352
Well, she's probably not human, so...

00:05:10.352 --> 00:05:13.105
I'd rather you not shoot
anyone until you're sure.

00:05:13.105 --> 00:05:15.941
So, what's the plan?

00:05:15.941 --> 00:05:20.320
There should be a house northeast
of here. I've been there before.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.614
I thought we'd head there.

00:05:22.614 --> 00:05:23.991
What's there?

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:30.080
That's where I found my gun and ammo.
There might be other equipment there, too.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.375
Oh, I get it. It's like a supply point.

00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:39.047
Right. Having a place like that will be
really handy for our adventures to come.

00:05:39.047 --> 00:05:41.508
To come?

00:05:41.508 --> 00:05:43.927
Yeah.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.055
Oh, whatever.

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:49.141
Okay, let's do it.

00:05:49.141 --> 00:05:51.685
Okay, we're off!

00:05:58.483 --> 00:05:59.943
Think it's safe?

00:05:59.943 --> 00:06:01.653
Looks safe to me.

00:06:01.653 --> 00:06:03.530
We're dead if we step on a glitch,

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.949
so I'll keep a lookout with my right eye, too.

00:06:05.949 --> 00:06:08.076
Yeah, let's be extra careful.

00:06:08.076 --> 00:06:11.079
Pushing blindly ahead is way too scary.

00:06:21.256 --> 00:06:23.175
Here goes.

00:06:24.718 --> 00:06:27.304
C'mon, you can do better than that.

00:06:27.304 --> 00:06:28.597
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:28.597 --> 00:06:33.810
But seriously, is this really necessary?
You can see the glitches, can't you?

00:06:35.062 --> 00:06:41.068
Well... yeah, but who knows
if I can spot them all?

00:06:41.068 --> 00:06:43.278
I might miss one hidden in the grass.

00:06:43.278 --> 00:06:44.613
Oh...

00:06:44.613 --> 00:06:46.532
Here goes...

00:06:46.532 --> 00:06:47.574
Oh, my aching back.

00:06:47.574 --> 00:06:49.076
Sorawo, you're like an old lady.

00:06:49.076 --> 00:06:51.161
Old la--! That's not very nice.

00:06:51.161 --> 00:06:53.997
It's not like I'm in as good of shape as you.

00:06:53.997 --> 00:06:56.959
But you're stronger than me, aren't you?

00:06:56.959 --> 00:06:58.710
Or maybe not.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.421
Huh?

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:07.094
Well, I was always exploring ruins and
probably always had stamina to spare.

00:07:07.094 --> 00:07:10.848
But just climbing down that
long ladder is totally exhausting.

00:07:10.848 --> 00:07:14.226
Stop throwing so many rocks if it tires you out.

00:07:14.226 --> 00:07:15.811
I'll do it.

00:07:22.484 --> 00:07:24.027
That was close.

00:07:24.027 --> 00:07:27.406
See? We really do have to do this.

00:07:27.406 --> 00:07:29.658
I see your point.

00:07:31.743 --> 00:07:36.582
Having to throw rocks the whole
time we walk really is exhausting.

00:07:36.582 --> 00:07:40.043
Right? I get why they
have limits on pitch counts.

00:07:40.043 --> 00:07:42.504
What's that?

00:07:42.504 --> 00:07:44.673
There's gotta be a better way.

00:07:44.673 --> 00:07:47.384
Better than having to retrieve rocks each time?

00:07:47.384 --> 00:07:52.181
Right. They don't always land
in the most convenient locations.

00:07:52.181 --> 00:07:54.683
What if we tie a string
to one? We could reuse it.

00:07:54.683 --> 00:07:56.101
A string?

00:07:58.395 --> 00:08:00.439
Toss it like this.

00:08:02.149 --> 00:08:05.319
We know it's safe up to the
point the rock landed, right?

00:08:05.319 --> 00:08:08.113
No need to bend over, either.

00:08:08.113 --> 00:08:09.448
That makes perfect sense.

00:08:09.448 --> 00:08:10.657
I know, right?

00:08:10.657 --> 00:08:12.826
She's smarter than I thought.

00:08:12.826 --> 00:08:16.955
Oh, but if a glitch destroys the rock,
we'll have to retie the string.

00:08:16.955 --> 00:08:18.707
That's not a big deal.

00:08:18.707 --> 00:08:20.792
I don't mean to nitpick, but--

00:08:20.792 --> 00:08:22.920
No one's forcing you to.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:27.841
Holding the string could be
dangerous when the rock hits a glitch.

00:08:27.841 --> 00:08:30.469
Oh, that sounds bad.

00:08:32.846 --> 00:08:34.848
Death.

00:08:34.848 --> 00:08:38.435
And if you're pulled into the glitch...

00:08:38.435 --> 00:08:39.520
Death.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.979
You're dead.

00:08:40.979 --> 00:08:43.565
Hmmm...

00:09:03.544 --> 00:09:06.129
You know, it's kinda strange.

00:09:06.129 --> 00:09:10.217
When I came here with Satsuki,
we didn't do anything like this.

00:09:10.217 --> 00:09:11.593
With Satsuki?

00:09:11.593 --> 00:09:15.180
Yeah. It was as if she knew
where the dangers were,

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:20.519
so we just kept going without
freaking out about each step.

00:09:20.519 --> 00:09:21.937
Oh...

00:09:21.937 --> 00:09:29.570
So I didn't even notice the glitches
until we ran into Mr. Abarato last time.

00:09:31.154 --> 00:09:37.411
I didn't know anything,
so I just did whatever Satsuki said.

00:09:37.411 --> 00:09:41.748
So there's probably lots of
other stuff I didn't notice.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.793
Toriko!

00:09:44.793 --> 00:09:46.170
There's a glitch up ahead.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.630
You should've told me sooner!

00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:55.304
Hey, the forest is getting thicker.
You sure this is the right way?

00:09:55.304 --> 00:09:56.513
I'm sure.

00:09:56.513 --> 00:09:58.223
Really? I'm taking your word for it.

00:09:58.223 --> 00:10:00.142
I'm sure... I think.

00:10:00.142 --> 00:10:02.978
Did you just say, "I think"?

00:10:02.978 --> 00:10:06.899
Now what? I don't see any rocks to throw.

00:10:06.899 --> 00:10:09.902
It's just bare earth.

00:10:09.902 --> 00:10:13.864
Let's keep moving. It doesn't seem
like there are any glitches around here.

00:10:13.864 --> 00:10:14.865
Really?

00:10:14.865 --> 00:10:16.825
I'm not sure.

00:10:18.952 --> 00:10:22.998
We're looking for a house, right?
What's it like? Is it big?

00:10:22.998 --> 00:10:26.627
No. Um, how should I put it?

00:10:26.627 --> 00:10:29.171
It's like it was built quick and dirty.

00:10:29.171 --> 00:10:30.255
Like a shack?

00:10:30.255 --> 00:10:32.007
Yes, that! A shack!

00:10:32.007 --> 00:10:33.717
So then it's small.

00:10:33.717 --> 00:10:37.804
Yeah, it was pretty cramped.
The two of us barely fit.

00:10:37.804 --> 00:10:40.474
The two of you. How interesting.

00:10:40.474 --> 00:10:45.938
I wonder what that shack was for.
It didn't seem like Satsuki built it.

00:10:45.938 --> 00:10:50.108
Maybe it was already there,
and she was just using it to store supplies.

00:10:50.108 --> 00:10:54.905
Yeah, and it also seemed like she was
using it as a stopover for long trips.

00:10:54.905 --> 00:11:00.786
So she may have been there already
and taken all the ammo and supplies.

00:11:00.786 --> 00:11:02.746
If so, I'm sorry.

00:11:02.746 --> 00:11:04.164
What happens, happens.

00:11:04.164 --> 00:11:06.583
At least you'll know whether she's been there.

00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:10.462
Yeah. Just knowing that
would put my mind at ease.

00:11:10.462 --> 00:11:14.716
Getting some bullets would put <i>my </i>mind at ease.

00:11:20.097 --> 00:11:22.015
Maybe it's over there.

00:11:37.322 --> 00:11:39.449
Is this what you were looking for?

00:11:39.449 --> 00:11:41.869
No, it wasn't like...

00:11:44.496 --> 00:11:50.419
I've never been here before.
What is this place? A struggling village?

00:11:50.419 --> 00:11:54.089
It's way past struggling.
It's a total ghost town.

00:11:55.215 --> 00:11:57.593
Should we go have a look?

00:11:57.593 --> 00:12:00.304
O-Okay.

00:12:27.998 --> 00:12:29.708
Sorawo, look.

00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:31.335
Find something?

00:12:42.721 --> 00:12:45.307
Why are there three chopsticks?

00:12:46.892 --> 00:12:51.313
This rice offering isn't freshly cooked,
but it's not dried up, either.

00:12:51.313 --> 00:12:53.607
Does that mean someone lives here?

00:12:53.607 --> 00:12:57.694
I don't know, but do you
remember what Mr. Abarato said?

00:12:57.694 --> 00:13:01.114
There are human-like beings
here on the Otherside.

00:13:01.114 --> 00:13:05.702
He did say that. So then, is this
some kind of Otherside village?

00:13:05.702 --> 00:13:13.544
I guess so. I just thought he was
paranoid or spouting conspiracy theories.

00:13:13.544 --> 00:13:15.379
Whoa!

00:13:15.379 --> 00:13:22.803
If there really are Othersiders,
what do you think they might look like?

00:13:22.803 --> 00:13:26.014
I'd rather not think about that.

00:13:28.308 --> 00:13:32.187
There really is no one here.
It's completely quiet.

00:13:32.187 --> 00:13:38.026
It's creepy. Listen, this isn't the
place you were looking for, is it?

00:13:38.026 --> 00:13:43.323
We should leave now before
we run into something freaky again.

00:13:44.908 --> 00:13:46.577
Toriko?

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:54.626
You've gotta be kidding me.
Come on, this isn't the time to wander off.

00:13:54.626 --> 00:13:56.628
She couldn't have picked a worse place.

00:13:56.628 --> 00:14:00.090
This is insane. What is that idiot doing?

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.634
This totally sucks.

00:14:04.428 --> 00:14:06.471
Tori--

00:14:08.473 --> 00:14:10.726
Toriko!

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.856
Toriko.

00:14:23.864 --> 00:14:26.074
Toriko.

00:14:35.542 --> 00:14:37.628
Shh.

00:14:39.379 --> 00:14:40.088
--Toriko!

00:14:40.088 --> 00:14:41.548
--Shh.
--Toriko!

00:14:41.548 --> 00:14:43.133
Where'd you go?

00:14:43.133 --> 00:14:47.346
Me? Where'd <i>you </i>go?
Don't freak me out like that!

00:14:47.346 --> 00:14:49.848
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:14:49.848 --> 00:14:52.559
Do you have any idea how hard I looked for you?

00:14:52.559 --> 00:14:54.353
You looked for me.

00:14:54.353 --> 00:15:00.067
Oh, well... it's not like
I was looking <i>that </i>hard.

00:15:23.882 --> 00:15:25.801
Toriko. Can you see anything?

00:15:25.801 --> 00:15:28.095
Something's moving.

00:15:28.095 --> 00:15:29.429
Is it coming this way?

00:15:29.429 --> 00:15:31.557
I can't tell. It's hard to see.

00:15:31.557 --> 00:15:36.311
I don't like this. I think we
should wait it out here and...

00:15:36.311 --> 00:15:37.980
Ah!

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:47.447
Ow. Ouch.

00:16:26.028 --> 00:16:28.113
What the heck is it?

00:16:40.334 --> 00:16:41.919
What is it?

00:16:41.919 --> 00:16:45.214
I don't know. It looks like
an insect or something.

00:16:45.214 --> 00:16:47.132
An insect?

00:17:04.691 --> 00:17:06.527
There's too many!

00:17:06.527 --> 00:17:09.154
Toriko, this is hopeless.

00:17:09.154 --> 00:17:10.697
Let's run!

00:17:14.868 --> 00:17:18.497
I knew I should've brought a rifle!

00:17:18.497 --> 00:17:19.831
This is bad. We can't go back!

00:17:19.831 --> 00:17:22.835
We have to find a way back down.

00:17:22.835 --> 00:17:24.837
"Big Heads"

00:17:25.462 --> 00:17:27.631
Sorawo, behind you!

00:17:31.093 --> 00:17:33.846
There's no end to them. Run!

00:17:38.475 --> 00:17:40.727
A glitch.

00:17:40.727 --> 00:17:43.564
No, it's our world!

00:17:43.564 --> 00:17:44.523
Toriko!

00:17:44.523 --> 00:17:45.941
There's our escape!

00:17:45.941 --> 00:17:46.567
--You sure?

00:17:46.567 --> 00:17:47.067
--I think!
--You sure?

00:17:47.067 --> 00:17:48.443
--I think!
--You think?!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.119
Here?!

00:17:57.119 --> 00:17:58.662
Now what?!

00:17:58.662 --> 00:18:00.122
Your hand!

00:18:02.416 --> 00:18:03.250
Grab it!

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.211
You need some serious people skills!

00:18:10.507 --> 00:18:13.093
Here we go!

00:19:12.819 --> 00:19:15.364
We made it.

00:19:15.364 --> 00:19:18.492
That was close.

00:19:32.172 --> 00:19:34.299
Ah, the guns! Hide them, quick!

00:19:34.299 --> 00:19:37.261
Oh, right! We could get in major trouble!

00:19:40.138 --> 00:19:44.977
We went to hell and back
and have nothing to show for it.

00:19:44.977 --> 00:19:50.482
Oh, no, I'm not blaming you
or anything. Just stating a fact.

00:19:50.482 --> 00:19:51.984
What?

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:56.363
What the--?

00:19:56.363 --> 00:20:02.494
It's just, I'm no longer sure what
the right size for a human head is.

00:20:02.494 --> 00:20:03.662
Huh?

00:20:03.662 --> 00:20:09.293
Has your head always been
this size? Did it get bigger?

00:20:09.293 --> 00:20:14.298
Don't rub it in! You small-faced girls
have a different bone structure!

00:20:14.298 --> 00:20:16.049
Just drop it!

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:24.141
My bad. I didn't mean it like that.

00:20:24.141 --> 00:20:30.230
It's not right for people like you to tell
others that their face is huge or whatever.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.107
You get that, right?

00:20:32.107 --> 00:20:36.612
No, I don't. Why can't I? It's okay for you?

00:20:36.612 --> 00:20:38.155
I'd never say that.

00:20:38.155 --> 00:20:39.656
Then what's the problem?

00:20:39.656 --> 00:20:41.366
Forget it!

00:20:42.868 --> 00:20:44.328
Hey.

00:20:55.088 --> 00:20:56.840
What?

00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:00.052
You really are my rock, Sorawo.

00:21:00.052 --> 00:21:01.261
Huh?

00:21:01.261 --> 00:21:05.974
I was so glad you took the plunge
with me when we were escaping.

00:21:05.974 --> 00:21:08.060
We should keep teaming up.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:12.523
Um, yeah, let's do that.

00:21:12.523 --> 00:21:18.654
Keep teaming up? Does she mean that?
After what just happened?

00:21:18.654 --> 00:21:20.531
Run!

00:21:20.531 --> 00:21:23.867
Hey... wait!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:43.136
I think I was right.
I probably <i>should </i>rethink this.

00:21:43.136 --> 00:21:45.180
"Big-Head Village"
I think I was right.
I probably <i>should </i>rethink this.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:47.057
"Big-Head Village"

00:23:17.439 --> 00:23:18.524
Let's come up with an anti-glitch measure.

00:23:18.524 --> 00:23:19.399
"Big Head"
Let's come up with an anti-glitch measure.

00:23:19.399 --> 00:23:20.234
Seriously?

00:23:20.234 --> 00:23:21.652
Death.

00:23:21.652 --> 00:23:24.446
Sorawo, you know how your
right eye spots glitches?

00:23:24.446 --> 00:23:27.783
We should, umm, make
that eye as big as your face.

00:23:27.783 --> 00:23:30.077
You know, like as huge
as one of those big heads.

00:23:30.077 --> 00:23:33.205
Then you'd be able to spot
a bunch of glitches all at once!

00:23:33.205 --> 00:23:34.706
Problem solved!

00:23:34.706 --> 00:23:39.419
The next time I spot a glitch,
maybe I'll keep it to myself. Then...

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:43.423
What? Why're you smiling?

00:23:43.423 --> 00:23:47.094
Oh, no, it's nothing.
